{"id":"n77578-2-6","stage":2,"title":"천사 · 天使","scene":"文化与信仰","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77578-2-6-1","ko":"할아버지 제가 짐 들어 드릴게요.","zh":"爷爷，让我来帮您拿行李吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지","meaning":"爷爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"3","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"짐","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}},{"text":"들어","meaning":"提，拿","explanation":"들다：提，拿；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"2","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어","audio":"/audio/079c88dfcd6e6363232f.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"(亲近)用于指称或称呼年老的男性。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"提，拿","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"将下面的东西往上拎。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e9d108d4ee806e0ce9e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77578-2-6-2","ko":"고마워. 천사 같은 마음씨를 가진 학생이네.","zh":"谢谢。你真是个心地善良得像天使一样的学生啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고마워","audio":"/audio/e9e8361d4662874097d3.mp3"}},{"text":"천사","meaning":"天使","explanation":"천사：天使","readings":[{"term":"천사","audio":"/audio/6174b898dd24d90f4811.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77578","senseId":"2","lemma":"천사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"천사","audio":"/audio/6174b898dd24d90f4811.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"마음씨를","meaning":"心地","explanation":"마음씨：心地；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마음씨","audio":"/audio/857a7017d8333dda2e36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15731","senseId":"1","lemma":"마음씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음씨를","audio":"/audio/c31db632953f45786818.mp3"}},{"text":"가진","meaning":"怀有，感","explanation":"가지다：怀有，感；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"11","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가진","audio":"/audio/644dc830c487f10763d5.mp3"}},{"text":"학생이네.","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학생이네","audio":"/audio/d2e559d084da7f467b9f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"6174b898dd24d90f","term":"천사","zh":"天使","audio":"/audio/6174b898dd24d90f4811.mp3","entryId":"77578","definition":"(喻义)纯洁、善良的人。","pronunciation":["천사"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"857a7017d8333dda","term":"마음씨","zh":"心地","audio":"/audio/857a7017d8333dda2e36.mp3","entryId":"15731","definition":"用心的态度。","pronunciation":["마음씨"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"怀有，感","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"心里有想法、态度、思想等。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]}],"audio":"/audio/4faefdc00bff9bdbc290.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=77578","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"source